  <p><em>This is a courtesy translation. The <a href="/blindnote/privacy-policy/" hreflang="es" lang="es">Spanish version</a> is the original and prevails in case of any discrepancy.</em></p>
  <p><strong>Kuxar Studio</strong> (“we”) operates the mobile application BlindNote.</p>

  <h2>1. Information and consent</h2>
  <p>BlindNote is a music quiz game. By using the application, you accept the processing of information under this policy.</p>

  <h2>2. Third-party services</h2>
  <p>To work properly, the app uses the following services, which may collect data under their own policies:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Spotify SDK:</strong> used to play song excerpts. We do not store your account data. See <a href="https://www.spotify.com/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spotify’s Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Google AdMob:</strong> shows ads. Google may use your device’s advertising ID.</li>
    <li><strong>Firebase Analytics:</strong> collects anonymous usage statistics to improve the game.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Personal data</h2>
  <p>We do not collect or sell personally identifiable information (such as emails or names) on our servers.</p>

  <h2>4. Data deletion</h2>
  <p>See how to revoke access or request deletion on the <a href="/en/blindnote/delete-account/">data deletion page</a>.</p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have questions, write to us at: <a href="mailto:admin@kuxarstudio.com">admin@kuxarstudio.com</a></p>
</LegalPage>
